    {
      "id": "p5-code-boundary",
      "eyebrow": "复合边界",
      "title": "只复合读，不复合写",
      "content": {
        "kind": "code",
        "language": "python",
        "lines": [
          {
            "code": "# ✅ 读链：可以焊死",
            "comment": "三次观测变一条，省上下文",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "def check_order(user_id, time_range):",
            "comment": "查列表 → 锁最近一单 → 连物流",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "    orders = list_orders(user_id, time_range)",
            "comment": "",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "    recent = orders[0]  # 取最近一单",
            "comment": "",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "    logistics = query_logistics(recent.id)",
            "comment": "",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "    return {\"order\": recent, \"logistics\": logistics}",
            "comment": "",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "",
            "comment": "",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "# ❌ 副作用：必须独立",
            "comment": "不可逆操作不能藏在复合深处",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "def refund_order(order_id, reason):",
            "comment": "独立工具 + ACI③ 护栏",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "    # 这里要人工审核、硬阻断",
            "comment": "",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "    return create_refund(order_id, reason)",
            "comment": "",
            "highlight": null
          }
        ],
        "note": "读操作错了重跑零风险；写操作错了真出事"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "现在说一个关键原则：只复合读，不复合写。看代码。",
          "audio": "audio/tool-granularity/p5-code-boundary-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "上面这个 check_order 工具，把查列表、取最近一单、查物流三个读操作焊死了。为什么可以这样？因为读操作没有副作用，错了重新跑一次，零风险。而且把三次观测变成一条消息返回，还能省上下文。",
          "audio": "audio/tool-granularity/p5-code-boundary-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "但下面这个 refund_order 就不一样了。它是写操作，创建退款单是不可逆的。如果把它藏在某个复合工具的深处，模型可能只想查订单，结果工具顺手把退了。这就出大事了。",
          "audio": "audio/tool-granularity/p5-code-boundary-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "所以写动作必须独立出来，还要挂上 ACI 三级护栏，硬阻断加人工审核。记住：复合是为了顺，危险要拦。方向是相反的。",
          "audio": "audio/tool-granularity/p5-code-boundary-s3.mp3"
        }
      ],
